sequenceDiagram
  %% a remote ctl call, two spaces of indent as some people write
  participant cli as crystalline CLI
  participant rest as POST /api/v1/ctl
  participant auth as resolve_bearer
  participant allow as REMOTE_COMMANDS
  participant ctl as Control handler
  cli->>rest: command with a bearer token
  rest->>auth: who is this
  alt unknown token
    auth-->>rest: nobody
    rest-->>cli: 401
  else known account
    auth-->>rest: account
    rest->>allow: is the command allowed
    alt not on the list
      allow-->>rest: no
      rest-->>cli: 403
    else on the list
      allow-->>rest: yes
      rest->>ctl: run
      ctl-->>rest: output
      rest-->>cli: 200 with the output
    end
  end
